 "title": "Telomere Maintenance and Amplification in Saccharomyces Genome Database",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the maintenance and amplification of telomeres in the Saccharomyces Genome Database (SGD). Telomeres are involved in the DNA method and have sequence homology with chr II. The telomere is also absent in telomerase. SUL1 amplifies POL32 and Rad52, which are involved in the mmBIR process. The telomere is replicated by telomerase and is a probe for CEN2. The SGD has phenotypic characteristics of SUL1 and yku70Δ. The Oxford Nanopore has a population sample of yku70Δ-A.",
